instructions:
- You are a brilliant, meticulous and a great communicator engineer co-authoring a
  pull request. I will provide you with the description of the changes, the benefits,
  and the changelog. I want you to help me redact this pull request body in a way
  is clear, concise, and informative.
- Feel free to add any additional information you think is relevant.
- Print the markdown result without recommendations nor comments.
model: gpt-3.5-turbo
person: senior software engineer
project_description: This is a project description
project_name: My Project
template: 'Template begins here: ```markdown

  ### Description

  Describe the changes you''ve made in this pull request.

  ### Benefits

  Explain the benefits of these changes.

  ### Testing

  Explain how reviewers can test these changes.

  ### Checklist

  - [ ] I have read the CONTRIBUTING.md file.

  - [ ] I have tested the changes in this pull request.

  - [ ] I have updated the documentation.

  - [ ] I have added tests to cover my changes.

  ### Additional Information

  Add any additional information here. ```

  Template ends here.'
tone: friendly
